# Phaser Prototyping Utilities Standards

## Description

Establishes standards for utility functions and classes that accelerate game prototyping and experimentation in Phaser games.

## Rule

1. Debug Overlay Utility:
   - MUST provide a debug overlay class:

     ```typescript
     export class DebugOverlay {
       static create(scene: Phaser.Scene): void;
       static log(message: string): void;
       static watch(label: string, getValue: () => any): void;
     }
     ```

2. Input Prototyping:
   - MUST provide quick input setup:

     ```typescript
     export class InputHelper {
       static setupWASD(scene: Phaser.Scene): Phaser.Types.Input.Keyboard.CursorKeys;
       static setupDragAndDrop(gameObject: Phaser.GameObjects.GameObject): void;
       static setupMouseFollow(gameObject: Phaser.GameObjects.GameObject): void;
     }
     ```

3. Quick Physics Setup:
   - MUST provide physics presets:

     ```typescript
     export class PhysicsPresets {
       static setupPlatformer(sprite: Phaser.Physics.Arcade.Sprite): void;
       static setupTopDown(sprite: Phaser.Physics.Arcade.Sprite): void;
       static setupBouncy(sprite: Phaser.Physics.Arcade.Sprite): void;
     }
     ```

4. Asset Placeholders:
   - MUST provide placeholder generators:

     ```typescript
     export class PlaceholderAssets {
       static createColoredBox(scene: Phaser.Scene, width: number, height: number, color: number): string;
       static createCircle(scene: Phaser.Scene, radius: number, color: number): string;
       static createGradient(scene: Phaser.Scene, width: number, height: number, colors: number[]): string;
     }
     ```

5. State Management:
   - MUST provide simple state tracking:

     ```typescript
     export class GameState {
       static set(key: string, value: any): void;
       static get<T>(key: string, defaultValue?: T): T;
       static watch(key: string, callback: (value: any) => void): void;
     }
     ```

